            Archive of changes made during September 2009. The substantive content of this page should
            %strong not
            be altered. The announcement of the change to
            %a{:href => "http://www.math.ntnu.no/~stacey/Mathforge/nForum/?CategoryID=5"} the Forum
            and the reasons for it have been
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/2009+September+changes/397"} archived
          %hr/
          %h2#20090930 2009-09-30
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Toby+Bartels"}> Toby Bartels
              \: The lab elves are going to try to convince people to use the Forum for latest changes in October; see the new section about this at the top of the page. (If the instructions there are unclear, you can edit them now; I will move the final version to a permanent post on the Forum in 23 hours, after which you won't be able to edit them.)
          %h2#20090929 2009-09-29
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs Schreiber
                \: created
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/blob+homology"} blob homology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jon+Awbrey"}> Jon Awbrey
                \:
              %ul
                %li
                  %p
                    Added a ‘blink (= stub-link) at
                    = succeed "." do
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+order+proposition"} higher order proposition
                %li
                  %p
                    Added a quote to
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/precursors"} precursors
                    in which Hilbert borrows an idea from Kant.
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs Schreiber
                \:
              %ul
                %li
                  %p
                    added the example of automorphism 2-groups to
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-group"} 2-group
                %li
                  %p
                    added reference to the new article by Batanin, Cisinki and Weber to
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+Gray+tensor+product"} generalized Gray tensor product
                    – Mike, did you look at that?
                  %ul
                    %li Not much yet, though it looks very neat. It looks like they are going the “non-closed monoidal structure” route?
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Toby+Bartels"}> Toby Bartels
                \: More at
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SEAR%2B%CE%B5"} SEAR+ε
          %h2#20090928 2009-09-28
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Shulman"}> Mike Shulman
                \: Toby is
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SEAR%2B%CE%B5"} right
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zoran+%C5%A0koda"}> Zoran Škoda
                \: entry
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+crossed+module"} internal crossed module
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
                created
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+crossed+module"} differential crossed module
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zoran+%C5%A0koda"} Zoran Škoda
                created
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/general+linear+group"} general linear group
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Toby+Bartels"}> Toby Bartels
                \: I'm pretty sure that
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SEAR%2B%CE%B5"} SEAR+ε
